rt where ive used different tones by accident.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat changes would you like to see made on the Graphic Design team?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eMore members it has very few and i feel i can contribute to this role!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eHow active are you/how is your work ethic?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;ive got a dual screen and i have minecraft or forums on one screen and my software\u0026nbsp;on the other screen, so im equally\u0026nbsp;as active on minecraft as i am on drawing wich is about 8-9 hours a day maybe more.\u003c/font\u0